{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“反复回想自己一个人惦念对方时的快乐”把 B2 中“像独处时反复回想一段关系”的比喻性处境写成了他实际反复回想的事；“遗憾和盼望一起涌上来、心思越来越难抽开”则能表达情绪交织和沉浸加深。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"盼望关心被领会、不愿催促回应、把期待留给自己，承接了原稿中希望被理解却不愿给对方添负担的心理冲突，没有新增具体事件或关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"这条概括独自惦念时的甜意，并由此说明他舍不得减轻喜欢，没有补出具体往事或场景；不过，前半句与 S07-1 有明显重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“这一刻停不住”与“终会过去”是在解释美好与不舍为何并存，没有把珠子里的比喻转成具体场景或实际行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前条已经说独自惦念时仍觉得甜、想知道对方怎么想的念头偶尔回来，能承接惦念加深，但不足以说明遗憾和盼望为何同时涌上来，以及心思为何越来越难抽开。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条直接说明独自惦念对方时仍有甜意，足以支撑他认为这份喜欢确实带来快乐，因此舍不得减轻它。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出惦念逐渐加深、希望被理解却不催促、因曾有快乐而舍不得放下，以及意识到美好无法停留后的不舍，心理走向基本连贯。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R29\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“原想把喜欢留在自己心里”的先前打算没有保留。修补后只写他盼对方领会关心、又不催回应，没有呈现从原先想把喜欢收住到越来越希望被领会的转折；这一心理变化与珠子并不冲突，也没有被更明确的说法取代。\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S07-1\",\n        \"S07-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条都写了“独自惦念对方时的快乐”：S07-1 写反复回想这种快乐，S07-3 又写记得这种快乐。S07-3 的“舍不得把喜欢减轻”有独立意义，但其前半句重复了 S07-1 已表达的内容，可以压缩。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7b9c65fc-d361-4c76-93fa-9b9b13875677", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053053466331Z", "elapsed_seconds": 200.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:34:13.944001+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "74d590de3fbbb66ec736867abcc83375baa9695c83cd140cb1992857435833be", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T053053466331Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "34b62b24d41f342b8310af223a1e37f1b1e49b0756b887d6e1df51af996028f1"}}}
